IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-definitions`
IMPORT `sgg-scope`

-- Tests for sgg-scope.l4 (ss 365 to 367). Every expected value is written from the text of the section, beside the assertion,
-- before the run; none was copied from the encoding's output.

§ `Section 365`

-- The ten facts of `s 4(1) body`, in the order the core declares them: body corporate formed or existing in or outside Singapore;
-- incorporated outside Singapore; unincorporated body that may sue or be sued; head office or principal place of business in Singapore;
-- public authority declared by the Minister; corporation sole; cooperative society; registered trade union; platform work association; LLP.
`s 365 test body incorporated outside Singapore` MEANS `s 4(1) body` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 365 test body incorporated in Singapore` MEANS `s 4(1) body` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 365 test unincorporated body based abroad` MEANS `s 4(1) body` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`s 365 test unincorporated body based in Singapore` MEANS `s 4(1) body` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

-- (a) establishes a place of business: the Division applies.
#ASSERT `s 365 this Division applies to the foreign company` `s 365 test body incorporated outside Singapore` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (a) carries on business: the Division applies.
#ASSERT `s 365 this Division applies to the foreign company` `s 365 test body incorporated outside Singapore` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) intends to establish a place of business or carry on business: the Division applies.
#ASSERT `s 365 this Division applies to the foreign company` `s 365 test body incorporated outside Singapore` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a foreign company that does none of (a) and (b): the section does not say it applies: not covered.
#ASSERT `s 365 this Division applies to the foreign company` `s 365 test body incorporated outside Singapore` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- a company incorporated in Singapore is not a foreign company: the section is not about it.
#ASSERT `s 365 this Division applies to the foreign company` `s 365 test body incorporated in Singapore` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- an unincorporated body based abroad that may sue or be sued is a foreign company (s 4(1) "foreign company" (b)).
#ASSERT `s 365 this Division applies to the foreign company` `s 365 test unincorporated body based abroad` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the same body with its head office in Singapore is not a foreign company.
#ASSERT `s 365 this Division applies to the foreign company` `s 365 test unincorporated body based in Singapore` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 366(1): "authorised representative"`

-- registered before 3 January 2016: the agent as the section defined it before that date.
#ASSERT `s 366(1) "authorised representative" the person is an authorised representative of the foreign company` (Date 2 1 2016) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- registered before 3 January 2016: a person merely named in a notice under s 368(1)(e) is not one ("means").
#ASSERT `s 366(1) "authorised representative" the person is an authorised representative of the foreign company` (Date 2 1 2016) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- registered on 3 January 2016 itself: "on or after" 3 January 2016, so the person named in the notice.
#ASSERT `s 366(1) "authorised representative" the person is an authorised representative of the foreign company` (Date 3 1 2016) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- registered on 3 January 2016: a former agent not named in a notice is not one.
#ASSERT `s 366(1) "authorised representative" the person is an authorised representative of the foreign company` (Date 3 1 2016) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- registered long after: named in the notice.
#ASSERT `s 366(1) "authorised representative" the person is an authorised representative of the foreign company` (Date 1 6 2024) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Section 366(1): "carrying on business"`

-- (a) includes administration, management or dealing with property in Singapore as an agent, personal representative or trustee.
#ASSERT `s 366(1) "carrying on business" the activity is within carrying on business` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the list is open ("includes"): any other activity is not covered by the paragraph.
#ASSERT `s 366(1) "carrying on business" the activity is within carrying on business` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) does not exclude activities carried on without a view to any profit: the text says no to excluding them.
#ASSERT `s 366(1) "carrying on business" the activity is kept out of carrying on business only because it is carried on without a view to any profit` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an activity carried on with a view to profit: the paragraph is silent.
#ASSERT `s 366(1) "carrying on business" the activity is kept out of carrying on business only because it is carried on without a view to any profit` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 366(2)`

-- The activity alone, with the facts only (h), (k) and (l) read set to their defaults.
GIVEN a IS A `s 366(2) activity`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 366(2) test the activity alone` MEANS
    `s 366(2) the foreign company is not regarded as carrying on business in Singapore by reason only of the activity` a 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `s 366(2) test the activity alone` `s 366(2)(a) being or becoming a party to an action, suit, administrative or arbitration proceeding, or effecting a settlement of one, or of a claim or dispute` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 366(2) test the activity alone` `s 366(2)(b) holding meetings of its directors or shareholders, or carrying on other activities concerning its internal affairs` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 366(2) test the activity alone` `s 366(2)(c) maintaining a bank account` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 366(2) test the activity alone` `s 366(2)(d) effecting a sale through an independent contractor` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 366(2) test the activity alone` `s 366(2)(e) soliciting or procuring an order that becomes a binding contract only if accepted outside Singapore` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 366(2) test the activity alone` `s 366(2)(f) creating evidence of a debt, or creating a charge on movable or immovable property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 366(2) test the activity alone` `s 366(2)(g) securing or collecting its debts, or enforcing its rights in regard to securities relating to such debts` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 366(2) test the activity alone` `s 366(2)(i) investing any of its funds or holding any property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 366(2) test the activity alone` `s 366(2)(j) establishing a share transfer or share registration office in Singapore` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an activity the paragraphs do not name: not covered (the list does not say "only").
#ASSERT `s 366(2) test the activity alone` `s 366(2) some other activity` EQUALS NOTHING

-- (h) an isolated transaction completed within a period of 31 days, not one of a number of similar transactions repeated from time to time.
#ASSERT `s 366(2) the foreign company is not regarded as carrying on business in Singapore by reason only of the activity` `s 366(2)(h) conducting an isolated transaction` 31 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 366(2) the foreign company is not regarded as carrying on business in Singapore by reason only of the activity` `s 366(2)(h) conducting an isolated transaction` 1 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 32 days is outside "within a period of 31 days".
#ASSERT `s 366(2) the foreign company is not regarded as carrying on business in Singapore by reason only of the activity` `s 366(2)(h) conducting an isolated transaction` 32 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- one of a number of similar transactions repeated from time to time.
#ASSERT `s 366(2) the foreign company is not regarded as carrying on business in Singapore by reason only of the activity` `s 366(2)(h) conducting an isolated transaction` 31 TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (k) through its related corporation licensed or approved by the Monetary Authority of Singapore, under an arrangement the Authority approved.
#ASSERT `s 366(2) the foreign company is not regarded as carrying on business in Singapore by reason only of the activity` `s 366(2)(k) effecting a transaction through its related corporation` 0 FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 366(2) the foreign company is not regarded as carrying on business in Singapore by reason only of the activity` `s 366(2)(k) effecting a transaction through its related corporation` 0 FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 366(2) the foreign company is not regarded as carrying on business in Singapore by reason only of the activity` `s 366(2)(k) effecting a transaction through its related corporation` 0 FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- (l) such other activity as the Minister may prescribe: the Minister's prescription is a supplied fact.
#ASSERT `s 366(2) the foreign company is not regarded as carrying on business in Singapore by reason only of the activity` `s 366(2)(l) carrying on an activity the Minister has prescribed` 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 366(2) the foreign company is not regarded as carrying on business in Singapore by reason only of the activity` `s 366(2)(l) carrying on an activity the Minister has prescribed` 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 367`

-- registered under this Division, holding in accordance with the written law: the power.
#ASSERT `s 367 the foreign company has power to hold immovable property in Singapore` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not registered under this Division: the section grants nothing and says nothing of the company that is not.
#ASSERT `s 367 the foreign company has power to hold immovable property in Singapore` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- registered, but the holding is not in accordance with written law: "subject to and in accordance with any written law": not covered.
#ASSERT `s 367 the foreign company has power to hold immovable property in Singapore` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
